<title>UK: BADMINTON-SUDIRMAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-SUDIRMAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Sudirman Cup world</p>
<p>team badminton championships on Saturday:</p>
<p>Group 2 play-offs</p>
<p> Malaysia  3  Germany	2</p>
<p> Russia    3  Japan	  2</p>
<p> Taiwan    3  Netherlands  2</p>
<p>Group 3 play-off</p>
<p> Scotland  3  Australia    2</p>
